        <section id="roadmap">
          <h2>Roadmap</h2>

          <p>
            Umi‑Time is evolving toward a complete, multi‑language ecosystem.
            The roadmap below outlines the major milestones planned for the next
            phases of development. Timelines are approximate and will adjust
            based on community feedback and implementation experience.
          </p>

          <h3>Core Specification</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Refine and stabilize the Umi‑Time specification</li>
            <li>
              Expand examples and edge‑case definitions in the specification
            </li>
            <li>
              Formalize segment and refinement semantics for cross‑language
              parity
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Reference Implementation (JavaScript / TypeScript)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Complete solar‑geometry coverage</li>
            <li>Finalize formatting and parsing APIs</li>
            <li>Improve error diagnostics and uncertainty reporting</li>
            <li>
              Publish additional demos (map, clock, solar‑context
              visualizations)
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Language Bindings</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Python binding with full module parity</li>
            <li>Rust binding with zero‑copy geometry primitives</li>
            <li>C++ binding for embedded and high‑performance environments</li>
            <li>Shared test suite across all bindings</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Tools & Ecosystem</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
              CLI utilities for converting and inspecting Umi‑Time strings
            </li>
            <li>Browser‑based playground for interactive exploration</li>
            <li>Reference datasets for sunrise/sunset validation</li>
            <li>
              Integration examples for mapping and visualization frameworks
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Community & Governance</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Establish the Umi‑Time GitHub organization</li>
            <li>Define contribution guidelines and module ownership</li>
            <li>Publish long‑term adoption and compatibility policy</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            As the ecosystem grows, the roadmap will continue to evolve.
            Community feedback is encouraged and will guide future priorities.
          </p>
        </section>
